# Companions sample. Tag any NPC with /lowtalk tag companion while looking at it, then talk to it in Adventure mode.
npc: @companion
speaker: Companion
title: Companion

== start
<<if following()>>
  <<jump travelling>>
<<elseif waiting()>>
  <<jump waiting>>
<<endif>>
Need a hand out there? I can come along.
-> Come with me.
    <<follow>>
    <<end>>
-> Not right now.
    <<end>>

== travelling
Where to next?
-> Wait here for me.
    <<stay>>
    <<end>>
-> You can go now. Thank you.
    <<dismiss>>
    <<end>>
-> Nothing, carry on.
    <<end>>

== waiting
Ready when you are.
-> Follow me.
    <<follow>>
    <<end>>
-> You can go now. Thank you.
    <<dismiss>>
    <<end>>
-> Keep waiting.
    <<end>>
